<title>USA: Kerr-McGee names Luke Corbett chairman,CEO.</title>
<headline>Kerr-McGee names Luke Corbett chairman,CEO.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kerr-McGee Corp said on Monday it has named Luke Corbett chairman and chief executive officer, succeeding Frank McPherson.</p>
<p>McPherson has retired after 14 years as chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>Tom McDaniel, previously senior vice president and corporate secretary, was named vice chairman, Kerr-McGee said.</p>
</text>
